<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<%- include('partials/head') %>
<body>
  <%- include('partials/header') %>
  
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>🌱 About Our Mission</h1>
      <p>Connecting people with amazing vegan restaurants across America</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <main class="container">
    <section class="about-content">
      <div class="content-grid">
        <div class="main-content">
          <h2>Our Story</h2>
          <p>We believe that plant-based dining should be accessible, delicious, and easy to find. Our directory was created to help vegans, vegetarians, and curious food lovers discover incredible restaurants that prioritize plant-based cuisine.</p>
          
          <h2>What We Do</h2>
          <p>We curate and verify vegan restaurants across all 50 states, providing detailed information including menus, reviews, hours, and contact details. Our goal is to make it simple for anyone to find great vegan food, whether they're at home or traveling.</p>
          
          <h2>Our Values</h2>
          <ul class="values-list">
            <li><strong>🌍 Sustainability:</strong> Supporting restaurants that care about the planet</li>
            <li><strong>🤝 Community:</strong> Building connections between diners and restaurants</li>
            <li><strong>✨ Quality:</strong> Featuring only the best plant-based dining experiences</li>
            <li><strong>📍 Accessibility:</strong> Making vegan food easy to find everywhere</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        
        <div class="sidebar">
          <div class="stats-card">
            <h3>By the Numbers</h3>
            <div class="stat-item">
              <span class="number">1000+</span>
              <span class="label">Restaurants</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-item">
              <span class="number">50</span>
              <span class="label">States</span>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-item">
              <span class="number">25+</span>
              <span class="label">Cuisine Types</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>